    "Name": "Crockett",
    "Details": "A Star League era training mech, the Crockett was introduced in 2735. An 85-ton mech with a mix of weapon types alongside double heat sinks, the Crockett would go on to see frontline service as a command mech and assault mech. The CRK-5005-1 is an upgrade model manufactured for the Word of Blake and features a 255-rated Light engine alongside Improved Jump Jets. A pair of ER Large Lasers and an LB-10X form the bulk of the mechs weapons, with a pair of MML-3's as secondary weapons.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Pilot</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.15</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
